  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Five Xiangs grotto-heaven, after Myriad Thought Sword Waterfall crashes through stored wills inside heaven form, Fang Yuan activates the immortal killer move Swordsman. The lake water bubbles as if boiling. Each attack hacks lingering wills and causes cracks to form on the collective wills. He created both this move and Myriad Thought Sword Waterfall as compound killer moves, and he created Swordsman after becoming a human path grandmaster.",
      "chapters": [
        1821
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_five_xiangs_grotto_heaven",
        "move_myriad_thought_sword_waterfall",
        "move_heaven_form",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Duke Long, Fang Yuan turns his head and spits out a waterfall as Myriad Thought Sword Waterfall, then activates Swordsman. The moment Duke Long sees the killer move, he retreats, and Fang Yuan uses that opening to break free and charge toward Heaven Overseeing Tower.",
      "chapters": [
        1945
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long lists swordsman among Fang Yuan’s sword path combat system methods, together with immemorial sword dragon transformation, triple layered sword wave, golden thread sword, dark assassination, and myriad thought sword waterfall, with five finger fist heart sword as that system’s trump card. That combat system takes offense to the extreme, even more powerful than Fang Yuan’s time path style in that aspect, but Duke Long judges there is nothing to commend in other fields such as movement and healing.",
      "chapters": [
        1946
      ],
